---
import { CATALOG_GAMES } from '../data/glossaryData';
const games = CATALOG_GAMES.filter((g) => g.id !== 'suggest');

const input =
  'w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-lg bg-zinc-950 border border-white/[0.08] text-sm text-white placeholder-zinc-600 focus:outline-none focus:border-zinc-500 transition-colors';
const label = 'block text-sm font-medium text-zinc-300 mb-2';
const radio =
  'flex items-center gap-3 px-4 py-3 rounded-lg border border-white/[0.08] bg-zinc-950/60 cursor-pointer hover:border-zinc-600 transition-colors has-[:checked]:border-zinc-300 has-[:checked]:bg-zinc-900';
---

<section id="waitlist" class="py-24 lg:py-32 border-t border-white/[0.06]">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8 grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-12 lg:gap-16">
    <!-- Left copy -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-2">
      <p class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-zinc-500 mb-4">Acesso antecipado</p>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white leading-tight">
        Entre na lista de espera
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base sm:text-lg text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed">
        O beta abre por lotes, começando pelos jogos mais votados. Diga qual você quer jogar e como prefere ler os termos de cultivo.
      </p>

      <ul class="mt-10 space-y-4 text-sm text-zinc-400">
        <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-zinc-600 font-mono">01</span>Convite por e-mail quando seu jogo entrar no beta</li>
        <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-zinc-600 font-mono">02</span>Seu voto define a ordem de homologação</li>
        <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-zinc-600 font-mono">03</span>Sem spam. Seus dados não serão vendidos</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- Form -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-3 rounded-2xl border border-white/[0.08] bg-zinc-900/40 p-6 sm:p-10">
      <form id="waitlist-form" class="space-y-7">
        <div>
          <label for="waitlist-email" class={label}>E-mail</label>
          <input type="email" id="waitlist-email" name="email" required placeholder="voce@exemplo.com" class={input} />
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-5">
          <div>
            <label for="waitlist-game" class={label}>Jogo de interesse</label>
            <select id="waitlist-game" name="primary_game" class={input}>
              {games.map((g) => <option value={g.id}>{g.title}</option>)}
              <option value="other">Outro jogo</option>
            </select>
          </div>
          <div>
            <label for="waitlist-style" class={label}>Termos de cultivo</label>
            <select id="waitlist-style" name="glossary_style" class={input}>
              <option value="hybrid">Híbrido · Alma Nascente (Nascent Soul)</option>
              <option value="pt_only">100% português · Alma Nascente</option>
              <option value="en_terms">Inglês · Nascent Soul</option>
            </select>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div id="other-game-wrap" class="hidden">
          <label for="waitlist-other" class={label}>Qual jogo?</label>
          <input type="text" id="waitlist-other" name="other_game" placeholder="Nome do jogo na Steam" class={input} />
        </div>

        <fieldset>
          <legend class={label}>Se custasse entre R$ 19 e R$ 29 por mês, você pagaria?</legend>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-2.5 text-sm">
            <label class={radio}><input type="radio" name="willingness_to_pay" value="sim_com_certeza" required class="accent-white" /><span class="text-zinc-200">Sim, com certeza</span></label>
            <label class={radio}><input type="radio" name="willingness_to_pay" value="talvez_qualidade" class="accent-white" /><span class="text-zinc-300">Talvez, depende da qualidade</span></label>
            <label class={radio}><input type="radio" name="willingness_to_pay" value="so_mais_barato" class="accent-white" /><span class="text-zinc-400">Só se fosse mais barato</span></label>
            <label class={radio}><input type="radio" name="willingness_to_pay" value="nao_pagaria" class="accent-white" /><span class="text-zinc-500">Não pagaria</span></label>
          </div>
        </fieldset>

        <button type="submit" class="w-full py-3.5 rounded-lg bg-white hover:bg-zinc-200 text-zinc-950 font-medium text-sm transition-colors">
          Entrar na lista de espera
        </button>

        <p id="waitlist-success" class="hidden text-center text-sm text-emerald-400">
          Cadastro recebido. Avisaremos por e-mail quando seu jogo entrar no beta.
        </p>
      </form>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script is:inline>
    (function () {
      const form = document.getElementById('waitlist-form');
      const sel = document.getElementById('waitlist-game');
      const otherWrap = document.getElementById('other-game-wrap');
      const ok = document.getElementById('waitlist-success');

      sel.addEventListener('change', () => otherWrap.classList.toggle('hidden', sel.value !== 'other'));

      form.addEventListener('submit', (e) => {
        e.preventDefault();
        const data = Object.fromEntries(new FormData(form).entries());
        const entry = {
          ...data,
          utm: JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('daotranslate_utm') || '{}'),
          submitted_at: new Date().toISOString()
        };
        // TODO: enviar para Tally / Supabase / Formspree
        const leads = JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('daotranslate_leads') || '[]');
        leads.push(entry);
        localStorage.setItem('daotranslate_leads', JSON.stringify(leads));
        ok.classList.remove('hidden');
        form.reset();
        otherWrap.classList.add('hidden');
      });
    })();
  </script>
</section>
